) on a same-ticker merge, and both leave the existing entry_notes untouched when the incoming one is empty/absent. Confirmed live: started the real backend (fixture provider, scratch sqlite db, alembic-migrated) plus the Vite dev server and drove a full browser walkthrough (Playwright script since no MCP browser tools were available in this session) -- added MSFT with a note (trimmed and sent), added AAPL with no note (entry_notes key verified absent from the POST body), then merged a second MSFT buy with a second note and confirmed via GET /api/portfolio that the real backend produced quantity 15, avg_cost_basis 303.33, and entry_notes exactly 'Breakout above resistance, strong earnings beat.

